#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/0-index.md:1
#: c6e3f3226eaa4237ba4c2856a4ca5325
msgid "Teleoperation"
msgstr "遥操作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/0-index.md:3
#: c5cada3844a0442abc6bbcabaa8b251e
msgid ""
"Start with [VR](6-vr_teleop.md) or a [game "
"controller](9-joystick_teleop.md). The other pages cover isomorphic "
"teleop, DexCap, Wuji gloves, Vive Tracker, and related assists."
msgstr "先从 [VR](6-vr_teleop.md) 或 [游戏手柄](9-joystick_teleop.md) 上手。其余页面介绍同构遥操作、DexCap、舞肌手套、Vive Tracker 以及相关辅助输入。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/0-index.md:5
#: 859ae3bcfc2f442dbfd4370be45eb883
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"VR, a foot pedal, or an exoskeleton report the current mode on "
"`teleop/mode_state`. A game controller or the keyboard report it on "
"`teleop_mode`. How to subscribe, and how that differs from the change "
"event: {ref}`teleop-mode-status`. Poses, sticks, and triggers that VR "
"publishes: [VR published topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-"
"published-topics)."
msgstr ""
"VR、脚踏板或外骨骼把当前模式发在 `teleop/mode_state`。游戏手柄或键盘发在 "
"`teleop_mode`。如何订阅，以及它和修改事件的差别：{ref}`teleop-mode-status`。VR 发布的位姿、摇杆和扳机见 "
"[VR 发布话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-topics)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "VR, isomorphic teleop, and DexCap. Drag"
#~ " teaching (拖动遥操作) is not implemented."
#~ msgstr "VR、同构遥操作和 DexCap。拖动示教（拖动遥操作）未实现。"

